# .agent memory (mandatory)

Before any work, read these files at the **repo root** — do not scan the whole project first:

1. `.agent/architect.md` — current structure
2. `.agent/remember.md` — preferences, decisions, gotchas, recent work
3. `.agent/review.md` — open issues + finish checklist

Then open only the files you need (app code is in `front-end/`).

After every task, do not skip:

1. Follow `.agent/review.md` (including `npm run build` in `front-end/`)
2. Update `.agent/architect.md` if structure changed
3. Append a task-log line to `.agent/remember.md` and record new decisions/gotchas
4. Update open issues in `.agent/review.md`

Canonical memory is root `.agent/`, not `front-end/.agent/`. Vue coding rules: `front-end/AGENTS.md`.
